      source: "Wikimedia Commons file 'Lata Mangeshkar - still 29065 crop.jpg': photograph of Lata Mangeshkar by a Bollywood Hungama photographer at an event (the file page names the source still as the launch of a painting collection), a cropped image on the Bollywood Hungama website; the original file is 440 x 400 pixels, saved unchanged (no resizing, no upscaling). Licensed CC BY 3.0 by the copyright holder, with a Wikimedia volunteer-team permission record (ticket 2008030310010794) and a review by a Commons administrator in August 2010 who confirmed the image was on the Bollywood Hungama site. The file page gives the date as 2008; the first upload recorded the date as unknown, so the year is the file page's statement only.",
